OL,3,GNEWSAMan asks to keep eating his food
OL,4,Aduring drive-thru arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer asked officers to let him
OL,7,Feat his chips when he was arrested at a
OL,8,Fdrive-thru.
OL,10,FImtiaz Ali, 46, of Ebenezer Terrace,
OL,11,FNewport, was searched outside a
OL,12,FMcDonald's in Newport Retail Park at
OL,13,Fabout 21:50 GMT on 2 November.
OL,15,FPolice found nitrous oxide cannisters,
OL,16,Funopened balloons and a hammer inside
OL,17,Fhis car.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
